股票公司股務處理準則」§2規定,本準則所稱股務,包含下列各項事務:一、辦理股東之開戶、股東基本資料變更等事務。二、辦理股票之過戶、質權設定、質權解除、掛失、掛失撤銷等之異動登記,以及股票之合併與分割作業。三、辦理召開股東會之事項。四、辦理現金股利與股票股利之發放事務。五、辦理現金增資股票之事務。六、處理有關股票委外印製事項。七、處理股東查詢或政府機關規定之相關股務事項。八、其他經金管會核准之股務事項。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"9039ce6b576fcc582f39a24c78e61a42745e9f562116db64966bbf2a765ac62e","explanationSegmentsSha256":"359af69f669efaa501e59a73c3171a7467a29d5d24fc4ac228161874fd881df9"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch08-pdf-0003","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":3,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch08/page-01.webp","x":172,"y":1201,"width":1048,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch08/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1350,"width":1160,"height":155,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"公開發行公司得委託下列何機關代辦股務處理事務?甲、綜合證券商;乙、證券投資信託事業;丙、具股務業務資格之銀行;丁、投顧公司","optionTexts":{"1":"甲、乙","2":"甲、丙","3":"乙、丙","4":"乙、丁"},"explanationText":"依「公開發行股票公司股務處理準則」§3第1項規定,公開發行股票公司處理股務事務得委外辦理;其受委託辦理者,以綜合證券商及依法得受託辦理股務業務之銀行及信託業為限。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"e705e6826ef18fc9a1e84c098225a91ab28892a86f82aba2b56a36a11cea4d17","explanationSegmentsSha256":"391d0b95aa7abf024dea0735f6b2cf09afff74fac37456fe8a61119d5c37e864"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch08-pdf-0004","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":4,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch08/page-01.webp","x":174,"y":1495,"width":1046,"height":151,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch08/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":200,"width":1160,"heigh