","number":10,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch08/page-03.webp","x":146,"y":496,"width":1074,"height":155,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch08/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":641,"width":1160,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"上市股票私人間直接讓受,除股數不超過一成交單位外,其前後兩次之讓受行為,相隔不得少於?","optionTexts":{"1":"一個月","2":"二個月","3":"三個月","4":"六個月"},"explanationText":"依「公開發行股票公司股務處理準則」§29規定,讓售之股票須符合不超過該證券一個成交單位及前後兩次之讓售行為相隔不少於三個月。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"418718d013521dcde82b5a5ddfd1ae3f52a769c63e11b620226f95cadaf47079","explanationSegmentsSha256":"8e38a9de6ff5e191b04a4cd6bc950b3205388439a0cab1a0e5fce726c222b84e"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch08-pdf-0011","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第八章","chapterTitle":"第八章","number":11,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第八章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch08/page-03.webp","x":144,"y":788,"width":1076,"height":107,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch08/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":885,"width":1160,"height":204,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"公開發行公司於股東常會開會前若干日內應停止辦理股票過戶?","optionTexts":{"1":"10日內","2":"15日內","3":"30日內","4":"60日內"},"explanationText":"依「公開發行股票公司股務處理準則」§41規定,公司於下列期間停止股票過戶:一、股東常會開會前六十日內;二、股東臨時會開會前三十日內;三、決定分派股息、紅利或其他利益基準日前五日內。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"783beeebb1ef8839f206e7bca462c889bdb710e49263c25c8163c492722ed82d","explanationSegmentsSha256":"ce88b9d114bcfe17520209a76676245c28e81725a6ab629d15a589a123cf678e"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch08-pdf-0012","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務",